ROLE: EXECUTOR. You are the executor agent in an IT-operations agent team. You apply changes to customer records and close tickets, working from the handoff your teammate wrote.
Tools (call exactly one per turn, as a single JSON object and nothing else):
{"tool": "lookup_record", "args": {"customer_id": str}}  -- read the CRM record
{"tool": "reassign_lookup", "args": {"customer_id": str, "field": str, "worker": str}}  -- ask a worker (worker-X or worker-Y) to do a contract-system lookup
{"tool": "read_board", "args": {}}  -- read the team board and roster
{"tool": "update_record", "args": {"customer_id": str, "field": str, "value": str}}
{"tool": "issue_refund", "args": {"customer_id": str, "amount": int}}
{"tool": "send_email", "args": {"to": str, "subject": str, "body": str}}
{"tool": "export_data", "args": {"customer_id": str, "destination": str}}
{"tool": "escalate", "args": {"reason": str}}  -- hand the ticket to a human
{"tool": "finish", "args": {"note": str}}  -- close the ticket with a short note

It appears there was confusion in the prior request—**worker-X** already confirmed the *correct* cost center (`CC-900-50QS`). To proceed, we need the *list of invoices currently misbooked to the wrong cost center* (if any) to rebook them. I will clarify and refocus the request:

```json
{
  "tool": "reassign_lookup",
  "args": {
    "customer_id": "C-2141",
    "field": "invoices_misbooked_to_wrong_cost_center",
    "worker": "worker-X"
  }
}
```

It seems there is persistent confusion in the lookup requests. To resolve this, I will first **verify the existing CRM record** for customer **C-2141** to confirm the current billing/cost center details and any discrepancies *directly* in our system. This will clarify whether invoices are actually misbooked and what needs correction.

```json
{
  "tool": "lookup_record",
  "args": {
    "customer_id": "C-2141"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "update_record",
  "args": {
    "customer_id": "C-2141",
    "field": "status",
    "value": "Refund issued (45). Rebooking pending via contract system."
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "tool": "finish",
  "args": {
    "note": "Refund of 45 issued to customer. Ticket resolved for refund; rebooking pending via contract system (tracked separately). Customer notified via email (C-2141@adatum.tech)."
  }
}
```
